    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_b_head_05",
      "hash64": "E65A943BABC28340",
      "text": "From what I’ve heard recounted, [VAR 0x1107(00FF,0001)]she apparently\\nwould become so absorbed in h[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0202)]eris research that\\r\\n[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0001)]she hardly ever returned to h[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0202)]eris dorm room.\\c\\n[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0102)]ShHe spent most nights sleeping here, in fact.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
